1912
01:07:20,880 --> 01:07:21,960
And you're still suspecting me?

1913
01:07:22,800 --> 01:07:24,080
Wang Churan!

1914
01:07:30,960 --> 01:07:32,440
Churan and Anyu are the same.

1915
01:07:32,920 --> 01:07:34,120
They're all of the Wang family.

1916
01:07:34,520 --> 01:07:36,480
Prejudice is a mountain
you can never climb.

1917
01:07:36,720 --> 01:07:38,160
Who else can we vote for?

1918
01:07:38,420 --> 01:07:40,220
(Three players haven't
revealed their roles yet)

1919
01:07:40,240 --> 01:07:41,360
It's Huang Jingyu.

1920
01:07:41,360 --> 01:07:43,040
(Keeping the act up)
We're being targeted.

1921
01:07:43,040 --> 01:07:43,940
You are it.

1922
01:07:44,060 --> 01:07:44,780
(Way too trusting)

1923
01:07:50,460 --> 01:07:51,380
(Huang Jingyu)

1924
01:07:53,200 --> 01:07:54,160
Huang Jingyu.

1925
01:07:54,160 --> 01:07:54,840
Not it.

1926
01:07:54,840 --> 01:07:55,840
Again?

1927
01:07:56,240 --> 01:07:57,220
I'm great at Werewolf Kill.

1928
01:07:57,220 --> 01:07:58,580
(My most embarrassing Werewolf moment)

1929
01:07:59,640 --> 01:08:00,040
No one trusts me.

1930
01:08:00,040 --> 01:08:00,600
It's Chengcheng.

1931
01:08:00,820 --> 01:08:03,100
(Don't challenge
the Werewolf Kill expert!)

1932
01:08:03,120 --> 01:08:04,520
Get him, Wang Churan!

1933
01:08:08,240 --> 01:08:09,400
So it's really you.

1934
01:08:10,080 --> 01:08:10,680
Then why...

1935
01:08:10,680 --> 01:08:11,920
Why did you chicken out?

1936
01:08:11,920 --> 01:08:13,280
Good thing you grabbed me
and threw me off.

1937
01:08:13,760 --> 01:08:14,740
That cleared your suspicion.

1938
01:08:14,740 --> 01:08:16,100
(Thanks to you)

1939
01:08:16,960 --> 01:08:17,480
That's great.

1940
01:08:18,880 --> 01:08:19,920
I'm getting the hang of this.

1941
01:08:20,920 --> 01:08:21,960
This is actually pretty fun.

1942
01:08:22,560 --> 01:08:24,480
Draw roles for Round 2.

1943
01:08:33,280 --> 01:08:34,960
Not a single person offered to help.

1944
01:08:36,380 --> 01:08:39,460
(I'm coming)

1945
01:08:40,860 --> 01:08:42,300
(Now that's teamwork)

1946
01:08:44,540 --> 01:08:45,580
(Better do it myself)

1947
01:08:47,240 --> 01:08:47,480
Alright.

1948
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:48,760
This round.

1949
01:08:49,160 --> 01:08:51,080
Let's see who dares act in front of me.

1950
01:08:58,960 --> 01:08:59,600
Like this.

1951
01:09:00,680 --> 01:09:01,760
That's too much.

1952
01:09:01,760 --> 01:09:02,380
Too obvious.

1953
01:09:02,380 --> 01:09:03,540
(Let's keep it real)

1954
01:09:04,960 --> 01:09:06,560
Everyone, close your eyes.

1955
01:09:09,600 --> 01:09:11,800
Mischievous Fish,
please raise your hands.

1956
01:09:13,280 --> 01:09:16,020
(Imposters: Wang Churan, Bai Jingting)
Okay. Please lower your hands.

1957
01:09:16,040 --> 01:09:17,520
Rules have changed this round.

1958
01:09:17,520 --> 01:09:19,260
Imposters don't know each other.

1959
01:09:19,380 --> 01:09:21,820
(New rule:
Imposters don't know each other)

1960
01:09:21,860 --> 01:09:23,740
(It's getting harder)

1961
01:09:23,760 --> 01:09:24,800
Begin.

1962
01:09:25,140 --> 01:09:27,460
(Mischievous Fish Doctor,
Second game, Round 1)

1963
01:09:27,480 --> 01:09:28,160
You go first.

1964
01:09:28,160 --> 01:09:28,680
I'll go first.

1965
01:09:28,680 --> 01:09:29,240
Go.

1966
01:09:29,640 --> 01:09:30,080
Set off!

1967
01:09:30,440 --> 01:09:30,840
Chengcheng!

1968
01:09:31,500 --> 01:09:33,580
(Imposters: Wang Churan, Bai Jingting)

1969
01:09:35,180 --> 01:09:36,380
(Got on easily)

1970
01:09:36,520 --> 01:09:37,160
Wait for me.

1971
01:09:41,260 --> 01:09:42,780
(Brakes just in time)

1972
01:09:43,200 --> 01:09:43,440
Come on.

1973
01:09:43,440 --> 01:09:43,760
I'm coming.

1974
01:09:44,360 --> 01:09:44,760
Okay.

1975
01:09:49,900 --> 01:09:51,820
(Makes it onto the platform safely)

1976
01:09:52,420 --> 01:09:53,060
(Teng is coming)

1977
01:09:53,080 --> 01:09:53,680
Teng.

1978
01:09:53,680 --> 01:09:55,220
He'll knock all of us off!

1979
01:09:55,220 --> 01:09:56,060
(This is bad)

1980
01:09:56,060 --> 01:09:56,700
(Just watch)

1981
01:10:01,720 --> 01:10:03,640
Teng!

1982
01:10:04,240 --> 01:10:05,840
The Beast is here!

1983
01:10:11,560 --> 01:10:13,200
He's trying so hard.
He can't be the bad guy.

1984
01:10:13,220 --> 01:10:13,820
(Innocence proved)

1985
01:10:13,840 --> 01:10:14,960
Okay.

1986
01:10:14,960 --> 01:10:15,560
Next.

1987
01:10:15,840 --> 01:10:16,320
Who?

1988
01:10:16,320 --> 01:10:17,020
(Asking from a moral high ground)
Churan.

1989
01:10:17,200 --> 01:10:18,020
Me.

1990
01:10:18,020 --> 01:10:19,700
(Mischievous Fish is coming)

1991
01:10:19,800 --> 01:10:20,600
How is she coming?

1992
01:10:21,040 --> 01:10:21,840
I'm crawling over.

1993
01:10:22,360 --> 01:10:24,020
My balance is terrible.

1994
01:10:24,020 --> 01:10:25,060
(Setting up an excuse in advance)

1995
01:10:25,160 --> 01:10:26,200
Okay.

1996
01:10:26,200 --> 01:10:27,060
Very steady.

1997
01:10:27,060 --> 01:10:27,780
(Takes up half the platform)

1998
01:10:27,780 --> 01:10:28,780
(Let me squeeze)

1999
01:10:28,900 --> 01:10:30,180
(Shoves)

2000
01:10:30,240 --> 01:10:31,000
(Why is she pushing?)
Don't lean on me.

2001
01:10:31,000 --> 01:10:31,760
I'm going to fall!

2002
01:10:31,860 --> 01:10:32,560
(My leg, move!)

2003
01:10:32,560 --> 01:10:33,240
No.

2004
01:10:33,240 --> 01:10:33,840
I'm right here.

2005
01:10:33,840 --> 01:10:35,840
(Moving away)
I'm making more room for them.

2006
01:10:35,880 --> 01:10:36,640
Okay.

2007
01:10:36,640 --> 01:10:37,440
(No one suspects a thing)

2008
01:10:37,440 --> 01:10:38,440
I need to look after the elderly

2009
01:10:38,440 --> 01:10:39,460
and keep an eye on the platform.

2010
01:10:39,460 --> 01:10:40,580
(The family would fall apart without me)

2011
01:10:40,860 --> 01:10:42,180
(Almost outed herself)

2012
01:10:42,500 --> 01:10:43,060
(Player count: 5/5)

2013
01:10:43,080 --> 01:10:44,040
If I charge over,

2014
01:10:44,040 --> 01:10:45,660
(Same old excuse)
won't I knock them right off?

2015
01:10:46,160 --> 01:10:47,480
Cut the act, Bai.

2016
01:10:47,780 --> 01:10:48,780
(Busted)

2017
01:10:49,240 --> 01:10:50,280
Run over here.

2018
01:10:50,280 --> 01:10:51,560
Catch me, Wang Anyu.

2019
01:10:51,580 --> 01:10:52,900
(Putting the pressure on him)

2020
01:10:52,960 --> 01:10:53,320
Come.

2021
01:10:53,600 --> 01:10:54,640
My hand is ready.

2022
01:10:55,180 --> 01:10:57,500
(Keeping the drama going)

2023
01:10:57,800 --> 01:10:58,720
I can't crouch.

2024
01:10:58,720 --> 01:10:59,520
I'll stand here.

2025
01:10:59,520 --> 01:10:59,920
In the middle.

2026
01:10:59,920 --> 01:11:01,340
(Squeezing in again)
Yes. Move a little here.

2027
01:11:01,920 --> 01:11:03,440
(Running out of room)
Don't step on Churan.

2028
01:11:03,440 --> 01:11:04,360
(but worried about the Imposter)
It's fine.

2029
01:11:04,360 --> 01:11:05,380
I've moved over.

2030
01:11:05,380 --> 01:11:05,860
(Moving in again)

2031
01:11:05,860 --> 01:11:06,900
(Everything's in control)

2032
01:11:07,180 --> 01:11:07,740
(Keeping him safe)

2033
01:11:07,760 --> 01:11:08,360
Come on.

2034
01:11:10,820 --> 01:11:12,340
(Can't hold it in)

2035
01:11:13,040 --> 01:11:14,080
Why do I feel so scared?

2036
01:11:14,080 --> 01:11:15,680
Look at the three of you.

2037
01:11:17,880 --> 01:11:18,920
You can do it. Trust us.

2038
01:11:23,100 --> 01:11:24,220
(Shaky)

2039
01:11:31,260 --> 01:11:33,380
(Throwing himself off balance
on purpose)

2040
01:11:37,020 --> 01:11:38,580
(Teetering on the edge)

2041
01:11:39,220 --> 01:11:40,860
(Hang in there)

2042
01:11:41,020 --> 01:11:42,220
(You get him. I'll get you.)

2043
01:11:42,220 --> 01:11:42,860
(You two are done for)

2044
01:11:50,740 --> 01:11:52,220
(All three fall into the water)

2045
01:11:52,920 --> 01:11:53,800
It must be Bai.

2046
01:11:53,900 --> 01:11:54,980
(Imposter found)

2047
01:11:55,000 --> 01:11:56,400
That was so obvious, Bai.

2048
01:11:56,400 --> 01:11:57,120
The Impostor.

2049
01:11:57,120 --> 01:11:57,720
(Instant spot)
Impostor.

2050
01:11:57,720 --> 01:11:58,720
He must be the Impostor.

2051
01:11:58,720 --> 01:12:00,800
He put all his weight on them.

2052
01:12:02,920 --> 01:12:04,400
Wang Anyu is the Impostor!

2053
01:12:05,640 --> 01:12:06,520
Wang Anyu?

2054
01:12:06,520 --> 01:12:07,680
(Under suspicion)
I'm not.

2055
01:12:07,680 --> 01:12:09,480
Bai yanked me right off!

2056
01:12:09,480 --> 01:12:10,240
(Under suspicion)
Bai's suspicious.

2057
01:12:10,240 --> 01:12:11,120
I did it on purpose?

2058
01:12:11,120 --> 01:12:12,440
Hu Xianxu, explain it.

2059
01:12:12,440 --> 01:12:13,680
I don't think it's him.

2060
01:12:13,680 --> 01:12:14,800
When he came over,

2061
01:12:14,800 --> 01:12:16,480
(Analyzing to join the good guys)
he charged straight at us.

2062
01:12:16,480 --> 01:12:17,800
I already let go,

2063
01:12:17,800 --> 01:12:19,440
but Anyu yanked me down.

2064
01:12:19,440 --> 01:12:20,160
Whose hand did you let go of?

2065
01:12:20,160 --> 01:12:21,520
My hand was like this.

2066
01:12:21,520 --> 01:12:23,080
We were holding on to each other.

2067
01:12:23,080 --> 01:12:25,080
It felt like...

2068
01:12:25,600 --> 01:12:26,800
He grabbed me first.

2069
01:12:27,600 --> 01:12:29,440
And sneakily yanked on me.

2070
01:12:30,080 --> 01:12:30,680
Bai is acting weird.

2071
01:12:32,560 --> 01:12:33,480
We got three left.

2072
01:12:33,500 --> 01:12:34,820
(Player count: 3/5)
Two are still on shore.

2073
01:12:35,140 --> 01:12:36,300
(Players needed to complete the task: 2)

2074
01:12:36,560 --> 01:12:38,640
Mr. Huang, move that way a little.

2075
01:12:38,640 --> 01:12:39,640
He could just kick them

2076
01:12:39,640 --> 01:12:41,120
and send them flying.

2077
01:12:41,120 --> 01:12:43,380
Do you know what a depth charge is?

2078
01:12:43,380 --> 01:12:44,740
(Depth charge attacks)

2079
01:12:48,800 --> 01:12:49,320
Alright.

2080
01:12:49,580 --> 01:12:51,460
(Leaping from a ridiculous distance)

2081
01:12:56,520 --> 01:12:57,560
A true, die-hard good guy!

2082
01:12:57,560 --> 01:12:58,120
Cool.

2083
01:13:04,580 --> 01:13:06,460
(Now it's up to their performance)

2084
01:13:08,620 --> 01:13:10,340
(First platform successfully unlocked)

2085
01:13:11,240 --> 01:13:12,440
Teng, where are you going?

2086
01:13:14,400 --> 01:13:16,440
(Crawling forward)
He's heading for the second round.

2087
01:13:16,440 --> 01:13:18,160
He wants to win the giant fridge.

2088
01:13:18,260 --> 01:13:20,020
(Still young and charging ahead,
Atlantic salmon)

2089
01:13:21,600 --> 01:13:22,120
Come on.

2090
01:13:22,760 --> 01:13:23,320
Keep it up!

2091
01:13:23,920 --> 01:13:24,520
You got it!

2092
01:13:24,520 --> 01:13:26,320
You're almost there. Come on!

2093
01:13:27,040 --> 01:13:27,820
Get on it!

2094
01:13:27,820 --> 01:13:28,780
(Watching the action up close)

2095
01:13:29,440 --> 01:13:30,040
Come on!

2096
01:13:30,640 --> 01:13:31,960
Don't make it sound so epic.

2097
01:13:31,960 --> 01:13:32,980
I was just crawling.

2098
01:13:32,980 --> 01:13:34,340
(Not one to be motivated)

2099
01:13:36,160 --> 01:13:36,600
I'll go.

2100
01:13:38,400 --> 01:13:39,080
Then it's my turn.

2101
01:13:39,080 --> 01:13:39,800
My turn.

2102
01:13:39,800 --> 01:13:40,240
Okay.

2103
01:13:41,300 --> 01:13:42,460
(Conveniently taking up half the space)

2104
01:13:42,600 --> 01:13:44,240
The next guy is a bit on the big side.

2105
01:13:44,500 --> 01:13:46,340
(Depth charge incoming)

2106
01:13:46,640 --> 01:13:47,600
Oh no.

2107
01:13:47,600 --> 01:13:48,440
Here comes the big guy.

2108
01:13:48,440 --> 01:13:49,520
He's here to gobble us up.

2109
01:13:52,200 --> 01:13:53,560
How will he get on this?

2110
01:13:53,620 --> 01:13:54,420
(Squeezing)

2111
01:13:54,440 --> 01:13:55,280
If he gets on,

2112
01:13:55,280 --> 01:13:56,760
Bing will have no space left.

2113
01:13:56,940 --> 01:13:57,540
(Room for one)

2114
01:13:57,560 --> 01:13:59,520
(Scoots over 0.1mm)
Where will Bing sit if I sit here?

2115
01:13:59,520 --> 01:14:00,880
Wait. Hang on a second.

2116
01:14:00,880 --> 01:14:01,680
Let's all stand up.

2117
01:14:01,680 --> 01:14:02,400
Let's stand.

2118
01:14:02,400 --> 01:14:03,560
I think we'll have more room then.

2119
01:14:04,280 --> 01:14:05,240
Can you wait?

2120
01:14:05,800 --> 01:14:06,760
Can you stand up?

2121
01:14:06,760 --> 01:14:07,600
(Who? Me?)
Do I stand up first?

2122
01:14:07,600 --> 01:14:08,400
Right now.

2123
01:14:08,400 --> 01:14:09,280
You can't stand up now.

2124
01:14:09,960 --> 01:14:10,400
Churan, can you get up first?

2125
01:14:10,400 --> 01:14:11,120
What about this?

2126
01:14:11,120 --> 01:14:11,720
Churan, can you get up?

2127
01:14:11,720 --> 01:14:13,160
I can, but my balance is bad.

2128
01:14:13,160 --> 01:14:13,520
Okay.

2129
01:14:13,520 --> 01:14:14,160
Wait. What about this?

2130
01:14:14,160 --> 01:14:15,160
I'll go first. My balance is great.

2131
01:14:15,380 --> 01:14:16,980
(What did I just hear?)

2132
01:14:17,120 --> 01:14:17,920
Who has great balance?

2133
01:14:18,720 --> 01:14:20,000
Tend says he does.

2134
01:14:21,720 --> 01:14:23,400
Churan, move over and stay seated.

2135
01:14:23,400 --> 01:14:23,760
Don't get up.

2136
01:14:23,760 --> 01:14:25,560
It'll make things worse.

2137
01:14:26,920 --> 01:14:27,160
Yeah.

2138
01:14:28,200 --> 01:14:30,100
(Imposter takes over half the platform)
A bit more. I'm right on the edge.

2139
01:14:30,100 --> 01:14:31,580
(Sitting on the edge)

2140
01:14:32,080 --> 01:14:33,600
(Core working very hard)
I'm in a bit of danger here.

2141
01:14:34,720 --> 01:14:35,320
Me too.

2142
01:14:36,320 --> 01:14:37,360
I just need a little space.

2143
01:14:37,360 --> 01:14:37,680
Come on.

2144
01:14:39,920 --> 01:14:41,360
This slide isn't as far as the last one.

2145
01:14:44,080 --> 01:14:44,760
Careful.

2146
01:14:46,340 --> 01:14:47,900
(Expanding territory amid the chaos)

2147
01:14:51,020 --> 01:14:52,380
(Is Churan my teammate?)

2148
01:14:53,040 --> 01:14:53,400
Wang Churan.

2149
01:14:53,400 --> 01:14:54,840
I'm about to fall!

2150
01:14:54,840 --> 01:14:56,040
Wait. I'm going down.

2151
01:14:56,040 --> 01:14:56,660
Did he make it up?

2152
01:14:56,660 --> 01:14:58,060
(Perched on the very edge)

2153
01:14:58,080 --> 01:14:58,480
Sit.

2154
01:14:58,480 --> 01:14:59,040
I'm not moving.

2155
01:14:59,040 --> 01:15:00,920
Sit.

2156
01:15:01,680 --> 01:15:02,320
Come on.

2157
01:15:02,320 --> 01:15:02,960
Don't fall.

2158
01:15:03,400 --> 01:15:04,160
He's up.

2159
01:15:04,160 --> 01:15:04,960
That's five.

2160
01:15:04,960 --> 01:15:05,700
He's up. I'm leaving.

2161
01:15:05,700 --> 01:15:08,580
(Wait. Hang on for 10 more seconds)

2162
01:15:08,680 --> 01:15:12,220
Eight, seven, six, five, four.

2163
01:15:12,220 --> 01:15:13,180
(Why isn't he falling still?)

2164
01:15:14,760 --> 01:15:15,120
Okay.

2165
01:15:15,780 --> 01:15:17,260
(Second platform successfully unlocked)

2166
01:15:17,280 --> 01:15:19,080
I hung in the air for 10 seconds.

2167
01:15:19,080 --> 01:15:20,280
(Using his all)
Hung midair for 10 seconds.

2168
01:15:20,600 --> 01:15:21,280
Go.

2169
01:15:21,280 --> 01:15:21,800
Crawl!

2170
01:15:22,500 --> 01:15:23,940
(Going all out)

2171
01:15:23,940 --> 01:15:25,900
(Going all out, Atlantic salmon)

2172
01:15:25,900 --> 01:15:27,020
(Went all out but running out of steam)

2173
01:15:27,080 --> 01:15:28,320
That's how an Imposter crawls.

2174
01:15:29,580 --> 01:15:31,220
(Put your back into it, buddy)

2175
01:15:31,760 --> 01:15:32,200
My back.

2176
01:15:33,020 --> 01:15:35,100
(Finally makes it to his feet)

2177
01:15:35,740 --> 01:15:37,300
(Imposter sets off again)

2178
01:15:37,600 --> 01:15:38,680
Keep a hand on Churan.

2179
01:15:43,560 --> 01:15:44,520
Churan, stand up.

2180
01:15:46,800 --> 01:15:47,680
Get up.

2181
01:15:48,520 --> 01:15:49,480
Move over a little.

2182
01:15:49,480 --> 01:15:50,360
Make some room.

2183
01:15:50,600 --> 01:15:51,200
No!

2184
01:15:52,340 --> 01:15:54,700
(Lost his balance)

2185
01:15:55,320 --> 01:15:57,940
(Fish Doctor failed)
My balance is great.

2186
01:15:57,980 --> 01:16:00,340
(It wasn't me. Anyone buying that?)

2187
01:16:02,180 --> 01:16:03,260
(So Churan is his teammate)

2188
01:16:03,600 --> 01:16:04,720
Well.

2189
01:16:04,720 --> 01:16:06,320
I don't think Teng is the Imposter.

2190
01:16:06,880 --> 01:16:07,640
I think so too.

2191
01:16:07,640 --> 01:16:08,900
I think Churan looks pretty suspicious.

2192
01:16:08,900 --> 01:16:09,820
(Suspects Wang Churan)

2193
01:16:10,040 --> 01:16:12,860
(Suspects Wang Churan +2)
I don't think she was playing fair.

2194
01:16:13,120 --> 01:16:14,600
Did she push you off?

2195
01:16:14,820 --> 01:16:15,420
(Suspects Wang Churan +3)

2196
01:16:15,460 --> 01:16:16,380
(Top suspect)

2197
01:16:16,390 --> 01:16:17,500
This is really tiny.

2198
01:16:18,040 --> 01:16:18,440
No.

2199
01:16:18,440 --> 01:16:20,620
She did make room
for the three of us just now.

2200
01:16:20,620 --> 01:16:21,660
(Person concerned comes to her defense)

2201
01:16:21,880 --> 01:16:23,160
(Her savior speaks up)
Yeah. I had to move back.

2202
01:16:23,160 --> 01:16:24,240
The next person is coming up.

2203
01:16:24,520 --> 01:16:25,120
So she didn't push you?

2204
01:16:25,300 --> 01:16:26,020
(Think back carefully)

2205
01:16:26,480 --> 01:16:27,240
Hard to say.

2206
01:16:28,080 --> 01:16:29,630
I think it's Fan Chengcheng.

2207
01:16:31,640 --> 01:16:34,200
He kept pushing me earlier.

2208
01:16:34,200 --> 01:16:35,240
I was on the edge.

2209
01:16:35,240 --> 01:16:36,720
I was scared of falling.

2210
01:16:36,720 --> 01:16:38,400
Besides, if I were the Imposter,

2211
01:16:38,400 --> 01:16:40,200
I'd be the last one to get on it.

2212
01:16:40,200 --> 01:16:41,320
When it's finally my turn,

2213
01:16:41,320 --> 01:16:42,480
I'll just flip the mat over

2214
01:16:42,480 --> 01:16:43,760
and stop him from coming.

2215
01:16:44,440 --> 01:16:45,680
Anyu, get involved in the game.

2216
01:16:45,680 --> 01:16:46,480
Don't just stand there.

2217
01:16:47,140 --> 01:16:48,820
(Mona Lisa Anyu)

2218
01:16:48,840 --> 01:16:49,840
Are you taking pictures?

2219
01:16:49,840 --> 01:16:51,600
(It's not a photoshoot)
Anyu, are you taking pictures?

2220
01:16:51,600 --> 01:16:52,880
I'm analyzing everything in my head.

2221
01:16:52,880 --> 01:16:53,960
He must be hiding something.

2222
01:16:53,960 --> 01:16:55,240
(Joining in for a cheap shot)
He's not speaking.

2223
01:16:55,240 --> 01:16:56,660
I say we vote Anyu out first.

2224
01:16:56,660 --> 01:16:57,860
(Switches target in an instant)

2225
01:16:59,600 --> 01:17:00,880
First of all,
I'm definitely not the Imposter.

2226
01:17:00,880 --> 01:17:02,760
I was analyzing

2227
01:17:02,760 --> 01:17:03,400
what Chengcheng said.

2228
01:17:03,400 --> 01:17:04,240
I actually saw what happened.

2229
01:17:06,120 --> 01:17:07,200
We have a better view

2230
01:17:07,200 --> 01:17:08,440
of everything.

2231
01:17:08,440 --> 01:17:10,240
You had your back to Churan.

2232
01:17:10,240 --> 01:17:12,410
She had all that space.

2233
01:17:12,640 --> 01:17:13,400
She was doing this.

2234
01:17:15,340 --> 01:17:17,020
(Showing off his sculpted back muscles)

2235
01:17:17,040 --> 01:17:17,440
Seriously.

2236
01:17:19,120 --> 01:17:20,560
Her legs.

2237
01:17:20,560 --> 01:17:22,000
And her butt.

2238
01:17:22,000 --> 01:17:23,480
She made a lot of space for herself.

2239
01:17:23,480 --> 01:17:24,320
No.

2240
01:17:24,320 --> 01:17:26,160
I'm afraid of heights.

2241
01:17:26,160 --> 01:17:27,640
(Afraid of heights?)
Afraid of heights? It's only 1.2 meters.

2242
01:17:27,640 --> 01:17:28,520
Yeah right.

2243
01:17:28,780 --> 01:17:30,180
(Speechless)

2244
01:17:31,900 --> 01:17:33,020
(Something's off)

2245
01:17:34,120 --> 01:17:35,270
Among the first three
who fell into the water,

2246
01:17:35,270 --> 01:17:35,750
at least

2247
01:17:35,750 --> 01:17:36,880
one of them is the Imposter.

2248
01:17:38,520 --> 01:17:39,960
Remember when Bai fell?

2249
01:17:39,960 --> 01:17:40,640
When he fell,

2250
01:17:40,640 --> 01:17:41,640
he said someone pulled him down.

2251
01:17:41,640 --> 01:17:43,080
So it had to be one of the two people

2252
01:17:43,080 --> 01:17:44,460
(Accidentally protecting a teammate)
before him.

2253
01:17:44,680 --> 01:17:45,880
We just need to see who Churan defends.

2254
01:17:45,880 --> 01:17:47,160
Wait. What?

2255
01:17:48,040 --> 01:17:49,400
They don't know each other's identity.

2256
01:17:49,400 --> 01:17:50,880
They raised their hands
with their eyes closed.

2257
01:17:50,880 --> 01:17:52,320
Don't talk nonsense.

2258
01:17:52,340 --> 01:17:53,780
(What if I actually guessed it right?)

2259
01:17:55,200 --> 01:17:56,240
Then let's...

2260
01:17:56,240 --> 01:17:58,320
So we're starting by voting out

2261
01:17:58,320 --> 01:17:59,320
one of the first three people, right?

2262
01:17:59,320 --> 01:17:59,560
Yes.

2263
01:18:01,440 --> 01:18:03,880
Okay. Among them, it'll be Bai.

2264
01:18:03,880 --> 01:18:05,680
(Oh no. They're coming for me)
Let me explain what I experienced.

2265
01:18:05,680 --> 01:18:06,680
Defend yourself.

2266
01:18:06,680 --> 01:18:08,200
When I got on,

2267
01:18:08,200 --> 01:18:10,040
I was at least pretending
to grab everyone.

2268
01:18:10,600 --> 01:18:11,960
(Pretending to grab?)
If you say...

2269
01:18:11,960 --> 01:18:12,520
If you're saying

2270
01:18:12,520 --> 01:18:14,160
that you were only pretending,

2271
01:18:14,160 --> 01:18:15,640
(You call that pretending?)
you're getting voted out.

2272
01:18:15,640 --> 01:18:17,680
My biceps were about to explode.

2273
01:18:17,680 --> 01:18:18,600
(I held on)
So you're saying

2274
01:18:18,600 --> 01:18:20,640
that you lost your balance at the start

2275
01:18:20,640 --> 01:18:21,880
and dragged us down with you.

2276
01:18:21,880 --> 01:18:23,360
Yeah. I lost my balance.

2277
01:18:23,360 --> 01:18:24,600
With pecs that big,

2278
01:18:24,600 --> 01:18:25,360
and a six-pack,

2279
01:18:25,360 --> 01:18:27,260
and those muscular arms,
but you still lost your balance.

2280
01:18:27,260 --> 01:18:27,900
(Did Bai lift for nothing?)

2281
01:18:28,080 --> 01:18:29,240
- He skips leg day!
- You need something to brace against.

2282
01:18:29,240 --> 01:18:30,360
- Every action has an equal reaction.
- He skips leg day!

2283
01:18:30,360 --> 01:18:31,810
(Skipping leg day backfires)
You skip leg day, huh?

2284
01:18:31,840 --> 01:18:32,600
You don't train legs.

2285
01:18:33,640 --> 01:18:34,600
You never train them?

2286
01:18:35,040 --> 01:18:35,800
Can't keep your footing.

2287
01:18:36,560 --> 01:18:37,160
Let's go.

2288
01:18:37,180 --> 01:18:38,340
(Time to vote)

2289
01:18:38,340 --> 01:18:40,220
(Bai Jingting*5, Wang Anyu*3)

2290
01:18:40,260 --> 01:18:41,820
(Bai Jingting eliminated)

2291
01:18:41,840 --> 01:18:42,400
Let's play.

2292
01:18:43,160 --> 01:18:43,640
Let's do it.

2293
01:18:43,640 --> 01:18:44,040
Come on.

2294
01:18:44,680 --> 01:18:45,640
You still have two left.

2295
01:18:46,600 --> 01:18:47,520
Not necessarily.

2296
01:18:47,520 --> 01:18:48,680
Could be just one now.

2297
01:18:49,200 --> 01:18:50,600
Someone get me a camera.

2298
01:18:52,220 --> 01:18:53,860
(New role unlocked: Cameraman Bai)

2299
01:18:54,160 --> 01:18:55,320
(Mischievous Fish Doctor: Round 2)
I'll go first this round.

2300
01:18:55,320 --> 01:18:56,320
Let's see who falls in.

2301
01:18:56,320 --> 01:18:59,980
(Mischievous Fish this round:
Bai Jingting eliminated, Wang Churan)

2302
01:18:59,980 --> 01:19:01,120
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2303
01:19:01,120 --> 01:19:02,760
Come on over. I won't stop you.

2304
01:19:03,240 --> 01:19:04,960
Aren't you a little too close?

2305
01:19:06,800 --> 01:19:08,040
You two go first.

2306
01:19:08,040 --> 01:19:09,440
(Taking charge)
Us first?

2307
01:19:09,440 --> 01:19:10,140
Okay.

2308
01:19:10,500 --> 01:19:11,700
(Eagle-eye mode activated)

2309
01:19:11,700 --> 01:19:13,260
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2310
01:19:14,280 --> 01:19:15,240
Pure happiness.

2311
01:19:15,300 --> 01:19:16,740
(Capturing every happy moment)

2312
01:19:16,740 --> 01:19:20,220
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2313
01:19:21,380 --> 01:19:22,060
(Deliberately capsizes the boat)

2314
01:19:22,120 --> 01:19:22,920
That's a little...

2315
01:19:22,980 --> 01:19:23,680
(Now you're looking suspicious)

2316
01:19:23,680 --> 01:19:24,840
Uh...

2317
01:19:24,900 --> 01:19:25,740
(Eyes on the target)
Hurry up!

2318
01:19:27,580 --> 01:19:28,420
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2319
01:19:28,440 --> 01:19:29,240
Just sit here.

2320
01:19:29,240 --> 01:19:30,440
Keep your feet there
so you won't fall in.

2321
01:19:30,440 --> 01:19:30,880
Okay.

2322
01:19:30,880 --> 01:19:31,160
You go over there.

2323
01:19:31,160 --> 01:19:31,840
(Sent to the edge)
Okay.

2324
01:19:31,840 --> 01:19:32,560
Make some room for her.

2325
01:19:32,560 --> 01:19:33,480
We don't want her falling off.

2326
01:19:34,200 --> 01:19:35,320
Don't push me.

2327
01:19:35,320 --> 01:19:36,400
Nobody's touching you!

2328
01:19:36,400 --> 01:19:37,040
Not even once.

2329
01:19:38,080 --> 01:19:38,800
Put your feet here.

2330
01:19:38,800 --> 01:19:39,720
There you go.

2331
01:19:39,720 --> 01:19:40,400
Good.

2332
01:19:40,400 --> 01:19:41,920
Now scoot forward a little.

2333
01:19:41,920 --> 01:19:42,640
(No hogging all the space)
Okay.

2334
01:19:42,640 --> 01:19:43,000
Okay.

2335
01:19:43,680 --> 01:19:44,560
You know what?

2336
01:19:44,560 --> 01:19:46,240
With that outfit and all that gear,

2337
01:19:46,240 --> 01:19:47,600
I couldn't even tell

2338
01:19:47,600 --> 01:19:49,040
if you were Bai or one of the crew.

2339
01:19:49,400 --> 01:19:50,960
Bai's a natural at this.

2340
01:19:51,180 --> 01:19:52,740
(An even better disguise
than the Mischievous Fish)

2341
01:19:52,760 --> 01:19:53,400
Here I come.

2342
01:19:53,400 --> 01:19:53,960
Come on.

2343
01:19:54,640 --> 01:19:55,800
Maybe you should let

2344
01:19:56,160 --> 01:19:56,720
those two go first.

2345
01:19:57,040 --> 01:19:58,280
(Calling the shots)
We're a little lighter, so we can still

2346
01:19:58,280 --> 01:19:58,840
hold on to the edge.

2347
01:19:59,440 --> 01:20:00,480
Let me get some momentum.

2348
01:20:00,920 --> 01:20:01,600
Up.

2349
01:20:01,600 --> 01:20:02,560
Up! Come on!

2350
01:20:05,440 --> 01:20:06,840
Keep your knee away from my face!

2351
01:20:07,240 --> 01:20:09,080
Keep your knee away from my face!

2352
01:20:09,420 --> 01:20:10,780
(Haven't we seen this before?)

2353
01:20:10,800 --> 01:20:11,880
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)
I'm actually getting scared, Teng.

2354
01:20:13,360 --> 01:20:14,680
I almost made a run for it.

2355
01:20:14,680 --> 01:20:15,000
Almost.

2356
01:20:16,040 --> 01:20:17,680
I was afraid I wouldn't be able to stop

2357
01:20:17,680 --> 01:20:18,840
and end up knocking you all
into the water.

2358
01:20:25,880 --> 01:20:28,360
(Cheng takes charge from afar)
Bing, can you move in a little?

2359
01:20:28,360 --> 01:20:29,180
I'll hold on to you.

2360
01:20:29,440 --> 01:20:30,700
Let me help Bing out.

2361
01:20:30,700 --> 01:20:31,700
(No chance to make a move)
Let's go.

2362
01:20:34,080 --> 01:20:34,780
Okay.

2363
01:20:34,780 --> 01:20:36,060
(Calling the shots)

2364
01:20:36,320 --> 01:20:37,200
Plenty of room.

2365
01:20:37,200 --> 01:20:37,840
Let's go.

2366
01:20:41,260 --> 01:20:43,220
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2367
01:20:43,260 --> 01:20:45,100
(Now playing: Dripping)
♪I'm dripping in the lake♪

2368
01:20:45,140 --> 01:20:46,220
♪The water's so murky♪

2369
01:20:46,260 --> 01:20:48,500
♪It's already up to my knees♪

2370
01:20:48,540 --> 01:20:49,860
♪I don't wanna go back♪

2371
01:20:49,900 --> 01:20:51,020
♪Put me to the outside♪

2372
01:20:53,100 --> 01:20:54,940
(The boss is the first to fall in)

2373
01:20:55,460 --> 01:20:56,740
(Reporter Bai brings you live coverage)

2374
01:20:56,740 --> 01:20:58,660
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2375
01:21:01,020 --> 01:21:02,060
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2376
01:21:02,100 --> 01:21:03,660
(Boiling with rage)

2377
01:21:03,680 --> 01:21:04,560
There's no explaining this.

2378
01:21:05,520 --> 01:21:06,160
Seriously.

2379
01:21:06,160 --> 01:21:06,520
Fan Chengcheng.

2380
01:21:06,520 --> 01:21:07,080
Chengcheng.

2381
01:21:07,280 --> 01:21:07,760
Fan Chengcheng.

2382
01:21:07,760 --> 01:21:08,800
I know you're innocent.

2383
01:21:09,240 --> 01:21:10,680
(That fall clears his name)
What were you doing?

2384
01:21:10,680 --> 01:21:11,880
I stepped down too hard.

2385
01:21:13,740 --> 01:21:15,020
(Just what I needed)

2386
01:21:15,200 --> 01:21:17,400
But Chengcheng's slip-up
was pretty impressive.

2387
01:21:17,400 --> 01:21:19,200
He spent ten minutes
planning the whole thing,

2388
01:21:19,880 --> 01:21:21,440
only to fall in himself.

2389
01:21:21,900 --> 01:21:22,380
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2390
01:21:22,380 --> 01:21:23,320
(Who saw that coming?)

2391
01:21:23,320 --> 01:21:24,320
I figured I'd come keep you company.

2392
01:21:24,320 --> 01:21:25,400
You looked lonely down here.

2393
01:21:25,620 --> 01:21:27,020
(Thanks for the help)

2394
01:21:27,020 --> 01:21:28,560
At least we've still got enough people.

2395
01:21:28,560 --> 01:21:29,880
We've got the numbers.

2396
01:21:29,880 --> 01:21:31,580
(First platform cleared)
Come on, next round.

2397
01:21:31,600 --> 01:21:32,400
Who's going first?

2398
01:21:33,380 --> 01:21:34,400
If nobody's going, I'll go.

2399
01:21:35,500 --> 01:21:37,660
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2400
01:21:38,700 --> 01:21:40,260
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2401
01:21:41,860 --> 01:21:43,900
(Watching closely)

2402
01:21:47,560 --> 01:21:48,480
You scared me to death.

2403
01:21:48,600 --> 01:21:48,920
Come on.

2404
01:21:49,160 --> 01:21:50,040
That scared me!

2405
01:21:50,040 --> 01:21:51,240
You startled me!

2406
01:21:51,820 --> 01:21:52,820
(That reaction looks real)

2407
01:21:54,800 --> 01:21:55,800
Run.

2408
01:21:57,040 --> 01:21:57,480
Run.

2409
01:22:01,300 --> 01:22:01,860
(Over before it even began)

2410
01:22:03,500 --> 01:22:05,140
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)

2411
01:22:06,280 --> 01:22:08,580
(Despite his suspicious moves)
I'm not the one!

2412
01:22:08,600 --> 01:22:09,720
There's no way you're innocent.

2413
01:22:09,720 --> 01:22:10,720
I'm telling you, I'm not!

2414
01:22:10,720 --> 01:22:11,560
I swear I'm not!

2415
01:22:11,560 --> 01:22:13,120
Your acting's even
worse than Chengcheng's.

2416
01:22:13,480 --> 01:22:14,800
(Is that supposed to be a compliment?)
I just lost my balance.

2417
01:22:16,280 --> 01:22:17,780
I was only messing around
and lost my balance.

2418
01:22:17,780 --> 01:22:18,580
(That backfired badly)

2419
01:22:18,660 --> 01:22:19,580
(Only five players remain)

2420
01:22:19,600 --> 01:22:20,600
So now, none of us

2421
01:22:20,600 --> 01:22:21,640
can afford to fall in.

2422
01:22:21,640 --> 01:22:22,240
Right.

2423
01:22:22,900 --> 01:22:25,220
(Everyone must make it across to win)

2424
01:22:26,980 --> 01:22:28,260
(Tries to throw them off)

2425
01:22:28,280 --> 01:22:28,840
Okay.

2426
01:22:29,200 --> 01:22:30,000
I'll move over here.

2427
01:22:32,760 --> 01:22:33,600
Stand in the middle.

2428
01:22:34,480 --> 01:22:36,120
Jingyu, hold on to Bing's leg.

2429
01:22:36,480 --> 01:22:37,300
Okay, no problem.

2430
01:22:37,300 --> 01:22:38,300
(Held in place, unable to strike)

2431
01:22:42,040 --> 01:22:42,600
Who pushed me?

2432
01:22:42,600 --> 01:22:43,360
(Footage shot by Bai Jingting)
Hold still!

2433
01:22:43,360 --> 01:22:43,880
Hold still!

2434
01:22:44,200 --> 01:22:46,720
(Second platform cleared)
No, I was just trying to help.

2435
01:22:46,720 --> 01:22:47,720
Wang Churan.

2436
01:22:47,720 --> 01:22:48,360
(Not even trying to hide it)

2437
01:22:48,360 --> 01:22:49,400
I saw that.

2438
01:22:49,400 --> 01:22:50,480
She pushed with both arms.

2439
01:22:50,580 --> 01:22:51,540
(Imagine how hard she pushed)

2440
01:22:52,200 --> 01:22:53,320
She went all out.

2441
01:22:53,760 --> 01:22:55,470
Fan Chengcheng, you've bruised me.

2442
01:22:57,080 --> 01:22:58,800
You shook me up so bad.

2443
01:22:58,800 --> 01:22:59,360
Right here.

2444
01:23:00,320 --> 01:23:01,280
I'm heading over first.

2445
01:23:01,540 --> 01:23:03,260
(On to the third platform)

2446
01:23:05,800 --> 01:23:06,640
Wait a second.

2447
01:23:06,640 --> 01:23:07,560
Oh man, I'm scared.

2448
01:23:07,560 --> 01:23:08,520
Don't go.

2449
01:23:08,520 --> 01:23:08,880
I'm seriously scared.

2450
01:23:08,880 --> 01:23:10,340
(Goes ahead anyway)
No, you're definitely gonna fall in.

2451
01:23:10,820 --> 01:23:13,460
(No stopping her now)

2452
01:23:13,520 --> 01:23:14,560
Where are you going?

2453
01:23:14,920 --> 01:23:16,160
Still pretending to be innocent?

2454
01:23:17,280 --> 01:23:18,520
