2475
01:23:47,360 --> 01:23:47,880
Don't stand.

2476
01:23:47,880 --> 01:23:48,800
Just stay seated.

2477
01:23:48,800 --> 01:23:50,000
You're afraid of heights!

2478
01:23:50,000 --> 01:23:51,080
Stay sitting!

2479
01:23:51,080 --> 01:23:52,840
And could you

2480
01:23:52,840 --> 01:23:54,280
