I was the first to fall in.

2494
01:24:29,640 --> 01:24:30,800
Wanna talk it through?

2495
01:24:31,520 --> 01:24:32,420
(The answer's right there)
Talk?

2496
01:24:32,440 --> 01:24:33,120
What's there to discuss?

2497
01:24:33,120 --> 01:24:33,760
Wouldn't that just make us

2498
01:24:33,760 --> 01:24:35,280
