2501
01:24:38,120 --> 01:24:38,880
I think earlier,

2502
01:24:38,880 --> 01:24:40,760
Churan pushed Anyu, didn't she?

2503
01:24:40,760 --> 01:24:41,440
I really didn't.

2504
01:24:41,440 --> 01:24:42,720
He's framing me.

2505
01:24:42,720 --> 01:24:43,960
(Ignoring her)
Let's vote. Churan's number one, okay?

2506
01:24:44,160 --> 01:24:44,920
I'm innocent, I swear.

2507
01:24:45,640 --> 01:24:47,640
(Yeah, we get it)
Sure, we know you're innocent.

2508
01:24:47,640 --> 01:24:48,840
Okay, three, two, one.

2509
01:24:49,540 --> 01:24:50,780
(Wang Churan*6)

2510
01:24:50,780 --> 01:24:52,940
(Unanimously voted out)
Okay, Churan is eliminated.

2511
01:24:53,160 --> 01:24:53,760
Game over.

2512
01:24:54,280 --> 01:24:55,400
The Mischievous Fish Doctors win!

2513
01:24:56,260 --> 01:24:58,060
(The Mischievous Fish Doctors win!)

2514
