2588
01:27:36,600 --> 01:27:37,960
Here comes our prime suspect.

2589
01:27:40,520 --> 01:27:41,080
Hu.

2590
01:27:41,920 --> 01:27:42,480
Hu.

2591
01:27:43,280 --> 01:27:43,720
Bro.

2592
01:27:44,400 --> 01:27:45,320
