So many washing machines.

2609
01:28:14,160 --> 01:28:15,520
Start a fire.

2610
01:28:16,000 --> 01:28:16,600
Steam.

2611
01:28:17,200 --> 01:28:17,920
Steam.

2612
01:28:18,240 --> 01:28:19,080
